					'That combination outperformed the raw vendor-only paths in our benchmarks (absolutejs/benchmarks) because it lets AbsoluteJS repair domain-specific terms after strong base transcription instead of depending on a second STT vendor to rescue hard turns.',
					'Minimal production-oriented example:',
